    "body": "fix on issue/2324-default-machine-disk-pin · PR #4078 · pinned by disk_recovery::a_repaired_default_machine_file_is_read_again_through_the_disk_reader · merges when reviewed\n\nThe PR is open and ready for independent review at `e0b968e9f9463479629873255b49fd43442152c7`.\nThe disk-backed test gets `Err`, `Err`, `Ok` for the missing, empty, and repaired file in one process.\nA controlled text cache makes the test fail at the repaired-file assertion.\nThe restored reader passes. The final quick gate passes all 10 suite tests, and strict Clippy passes all app targets.\nNo production behavior changes. The PR body lists the unrun lanes, including the release-mode light lane.\nGitHub reports no checks for the branch; this is not a CI pass.\n\nGitHub denied the earlier label and assignment update. This comment records the review handoff.\nThe maintainer decides whether to merge. The issue remains open.\n",
